but she soon takes it off.

00:18:17.066 --> 00:18:18.333
Why is that?

00:18:18.333 --> 00:18:20.733
Well, a great law creator, Ms..

00:18:20.733 --> 00:18:25.933
Charles, proposes that this moment marks
